    process_session_enumeration_errors_report_empty_2026_11_15, 0, "Linux getsid non-ESRCH errors and readdir errors are silently ignored; macOS getsid errors likewise skipped. The signal count can therefore masquerade as complete observation. Native Linux injected error regression: old 2 failures; corrected 0. Separate owned-child WNOWAIT API refuses ECHILD fallback; legacy behavior unchanged. See doc/08_tracking/bug/process_session_enumeration_errors_report_empty_2026_11_15.md."

